{
  "key": 54391,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "You!\n",
        "How is your Pokémon training\f",
        "coming along?\r",
        "Have you ever noticed that in the\n",
        "mountains, sometimes there are round\f",
        "boulders right in your way...?\r",
        "You can move them with the\n",
        "hidden move Strength!\r",
        "Hikers at Mt. Mortar sometimes have\n",
        "extra, or so I’ve heard..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Gobble...gobble...\r",
        "...Choke!\n",
        "Ack... I’m choking!\r",
        "Whew! That was close.\n",
        "I should chew before I swallow my food."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Whenever I roll into Olivine, I always\n",
        "visit the Olivine Café.\r",
        "Everything on the menu makes me feel\n",
        "stronger. I can’t stop eating!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Olivine Café’s menu is chock-full\n",
        "of hearty fare for beefy Sailors!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Hi!\n",
        "...!\r",
        "These empty dishes in front of me\n",
        "are not all mine...\r",
        "Er...\r",
        "Actually, the person who sat here\n",
        "ahead of me ate a lot...\r",
        "Anyway, do you want to exchange\n",
        "phone numbers? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Jasmine\n",
        "in the Pokégear!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Now we can contact each\n",
        "other anytime.\r",
        "I should be able to battle you around\n",
        "noon on Wednesdays.\f",
        "I’ll be waiting for your call!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00007",
      "en_US": "Jasmine: Oh... I understand..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Did you change your mind?\n",
        "Will you exchange numbers? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: We seem to...bump into each\n",
        "other often.\r",
        "Why don’t we take a picture\n",
        "to make this a memory? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00010",
      "en_US": "Jasmine: Are you ready?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: You did a fine job.\n",
        "We look good."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00012",
      "en_US": "Jasmine: I see..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0611_T26R0701_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC to delete\n",
        "some pictures."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
